(1891855, 260806, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. I wish that the sun didn''t create such a hot area in the upper left, but this is creative, "odd," (on several levels) and I like it 7</td>', 'This is pretty cool. I wish that the sun didn''t create such a hot area in the upper left, but this is creative, "odd," (on several levels) and I like it 7', '2005-11-23 08:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891860, 259638, 45857, '<td valign="top">Interesting qualities, soft and warm evocative of folk music<br/>IMO this might have been stronger if framed taller, ie more banjo neck at the top.</td>', 'Interesting qualities, soft and warm evocative of folk musicIMO this might have been stronger if framed taller, ie more banjo neck at the top.', '2005-11-23 08:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891861, 261152, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of staged shots per se, but this is clever, and certainly puts forth a message.  This would be great for an ad campaign.  I think if I were to change something, structurally, I''d make more area at the top, so that the shot''s dimensions weren''t so dissimilar. The clarity and colors are crisp ..... this also shows some imagination. 7</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of staged shots per se, but this is clever, and certainly puts forth a message.  This would be great for an ad campaign.  I think if I were to change something, structurally, I''d make more area at the top, so that the shot''s dimensions weren''t so dissimilar. The clarity and colors are crisp ..... this also shows some imagination. 7', '2005-11-23 08:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891880, 260129, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this - it''s funny, suits the challenge and is kinda creepy - perfect.  It has an odd setting for the people, they are doing something odd and it''s an odd number.  You thought outside the box - hurray for you!!!  It seems just slightly out of focus, but for your effort, originality and "meeting the challenge," you get an 8 from me.</td>', 'I love this - it''s funny, suits the challenge and is kinda creepy - perfect.  It has an odd setting for the people, they are doing something odd and it''s an odd number.  You thought outside the box - hurray for you!!!  It seems just slightly out of focus, but for your effort, originality and "meeting the challenge," you get an 8 from me.', '2005-11-23 08:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891886, 260523, 35545, '<td valign="top">Sorry.  I just can''t figure out what''s odd about this picture.</td>', 'Sorry.  I just can''t figure out what''s odd about this picture.', '2005-11-23 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891889, 259683, 35545, '<td valign="top">A lot of good color and a cute dog, but the background is so busy it''s hard to tell what this picture is about.  Sorry, but I don''t see anything terribly odd here.</td>', 'A lot of good color and a cute dog, but the background is so busy it''s hard to tell what this picture is about.  Sorry, but I don''t see anything terribly odd here.', '2005-11-23 08:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891892, 259846, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is not the greatest photo in the world, but it made me laugh.  Very original.  Great DOF. 7</td>', 'This is not the greatest photo in the world, but it made me laugh.  Very original.  Great DOF. 7', '2005-11-23 08:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891895, 259518, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Maybe a stretch on the challenge, but man, that is some color!!! With most of the other entries being snap shottish and lame, I''m giving you an 8.</td>', 'Very pretty. Maybe a stretch on the challenge, but man, that is some color!!! With most of the other entries being snap shottish and lame, I''m giving you an 8.', '2005-11-23 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891897, 260770, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really a fun shot.  I like it visually and it is whimsical, bright and interesting.  The tilt just adds to it.  Good for you for thinking outside of the box.  Most entries for this one are lame.  BRAVO 9</td>', 'This is really a fun shot.  I like it visually and it is whimsical, bright and interesting.  The tilt just adds to it.  Good for you for thinking outside of the box.  Most entries for this one are lame.  BRAVO 9', '2005-11-23 08:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891898, 259997, 43434, '<td valign="top">I like how the background works for this.</td>', 'I like how the background works for this.', '2005-11-23 08:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891899, 260346, 15711, '<td valign="top">I loved this.  But the leaves are distracting. I''d like just the stem and flower.  THEN you''d have a winner!!!  Nice focus and great use of negative space.</td>', 'I loved this.  But the leaves are distracting. I''d like just the stem and flower.  THEN you''d have a winner!!!  Nice focus and great use of negative space.', '2005-11-23 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891901, 260014, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - looks like a woman''s torso doing the backstroke upside down!!!  That IS odd. 8</td>', 'WOW - looks like a woman''s torso doing the backstroke upside down!!!  That IS odd. 8', '2005-11-23 08:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891902, 259833, 26773, '<td valign="top">Thats awesome! I usually dont like incense but...</td>', 'Thats awesome! I usually dont like incense but...', '2005-11-23 08:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891903, 261127, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT depth of field. With the monochromatic theme of the plant and stem, the greens and ambers behind it give it some appeal.  I like it. 8</td>', 'GREAT depth of field. With the monochromatic theme of the plant and stem, the greens and ambers behind it give it some appeal.  I like it. 8', '2005-11-23 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891909, 261120, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.  It''s so odd and unusual - perfect fit for the challenge.  That cat always looks scared. ha ha ha ha  The composition is great and the focus and light spot on.  If this weren''t the ODD challenge - I''d say "hmmmm what in the hell drugs did YOU take." ROFL<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'This is hilarious.  It''s so odd and unusual - perfect fit for the challenge.  That cat always looks scared. ha ha ha ha  The composition is great and the focus and light spot on.  If this weren''t the ODD challenge - I''d say "hmmmm what in the hell drugs did YOU take." ROFL 9', '2005-11-23 08:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891911, 260369, 48126, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture 10, easily</td>', 'Amazing picture 10, easily', '2005-11-23 08:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891914, 258336, 45857, '<td valign="top">Striking composition, like the frame too</td>', 'Striking composition, like the frame too', '2005-11-23 08:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891919, 260264, 15711, '<td valign="top">I find this extremely pleasant viewing.  The black/gold combination has great WOW appeal to me.  The single guy walking away on the left -really like it alot!!! Your use of silhouette and negative space is spot on. 9</td>', 'I find this extremely pleasant viewing.  The black/gold combination has great WOW appeal to me.  The single guy walking away on the left -really like it alot!!! Your use of silhouette and negative space is spot on. 9', '2005-11-23 09:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891921, 259596, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  IT''s inventive and very interesting.  I like the gus'' goofy expressions and their lighthearted faces.  It has a great smile factor. 8</td>', 'I really like this.  IT''s inventive and very interesting.  I like the gus'' goofy expressions and their lighthearted faces.  It has a great smile factor. 8', '2005-11-23 09:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891922, 259147, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great expression. Love the DOF and the smile!!!</td>', 'Great expression. Love the DOF and the smile!!!', '2005-11-23 09:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891926, 260859, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the "three faces of eve" sense that this has.  I think I''d really like it if each of the expressions were different, but that''s totally a nit picky remark.  FUn "overlay" of the faces and the lighting is almost hot - which really works.  I like it. 8</td>', 'I like the "three faces of eve" sense that this has.  I think I''d really like it if each of the expressions were different, but that''s totally a nit picky remark.  FUn "overlay" of the faces and the lighting is almost hot - which really works.  I like it. 8', '2005-11-23 09:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891927, 259995, 45857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, not much room for improvement.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, not much room for improvement.', '2005-11-23 09:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891930, 261020, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  The abstract aspect of it works so well. I can''t wait to find out what the picture is really representing.  The blue/gold tones are great complmentary colors.  The leading line works here as well.  Good one.  I see it in a chic gallery with rich people drinking coffee!! 9</td>', 'I love this.  The abstract aspect of it works so well. I can''t wait to find out what the picture is really representing.  The blue/gold tones are great complmentary colors.  The leading line works here as well.  Good one.  I see it in a chic gallery with rich people drinking coffee!! 9', '2005-11-23 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891932, 259833, 45857, '<td valign="top">Amusing, I''ll avoid the obvious questions and say the warm WB does work for the ....er... subject.</td>', 'Amusing, I''ll avoid the obvious questions and say the warm WB does work for the ....er... subject.', '2005-11-23 09:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
