(1892443, 260882, 45857, '<td valign="top">lol, you write your own comments.<br/>A good job considering your problems. A straight horizon would have ruined the composition and a step back would have showed more of the whatever on the left.</td>', 'lol, you write your own comments.A good job considering your problems. A straight horizon would have ruined the composition and a step back would have showed more of the whatever on the left.', '2005-11-23 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
