(1892513, 261087, 45932, '<td valign="top">Woah. this is definitely odd in many ways-3 goats, weird eyes, etc.  Good idea and interesting subjects, but the rope and other objects in barn are distracting.  Light in lower part of picture steals my eyes.  Great capture of the lambs though</td>', 'Woah. this is definitely odd in many ways-3 goats, weird eyes, etc.  Good idea and interesting subjects, but the rope and other objects in barn are distracting.  Light in lower part of picture steals my eyes.  Great capture of the lambs though', '2005-11-23 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892515, 260957, 45932, '<td valign="top">Different background would be better, and you could focus the shot more.  The glare on the glasses also bother me</td>', 'Different background would be better, and you could focus the shot more.  The glare on the glasses also bother me', '2005-11-23 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892518, 260387, 45932, '<td valign="top">WOAH the finger looks like a nub.  Cool photo and I love how the hand is just floating there, but I wish the cut-off hand line was straighter, not so jagged like a shirt.</td>', 'WOAH the finger looks like a nub.  Cool photo and I love how the hand is just floating there, but I wish the cut-off hand line was straighter, not so jagged like a shirt.', '2005-11-23 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
