(1893915, 259540, 6999, '<td valign="top">The tonality is excellent, and the contrast of that single whole leaf worls well. I wish, for such a simple composition (and only made the more simple by your choice of placement of subject) that you''d managed to avoid the green grass completely: I think it slightly upsets your theme. Nice detail, and an interesting approach to the challenge - if perhaps a touch straightforward for me.</td>', 'The tonality is excellent, and the contrast of that single whole leaf worls well. I wish, for such a simple composition (and only made the more simple by your choice of placement of subject) that you''d managed to avoid the green grass completely: I think it slightly upsets your theme. Nice detail, and an interesting approach to the challenge - if perhaps a touch straightforward for me.', '2005-11-23 19:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
