(1894196, 260755, 46045, '<td valign="top">I love this. i can really relate too. my little nephew is always on the move.   you captured a great moment in this. i really like his pose and position in the frame and how his eyes are hidden.   i''m just not sure about the contrast..i think i would like this better with more contrast. the way it is makes it actually looks like fog... or is it fog?   anyway, great image overall. :)</td>', 'I love this. i can really relate too. my little nephew is always on the move.   you captured a great moment in this. i really like his pose and position in the frame and how his eyes are hidden.   i''m just not sure about the contrast..i think i would like this better with more contrast. the way it is makes it actually looks like fog... or is it fog?   anyway, great image overall. :)', '2005-11-23 21:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
