(1894544, 261128, 39850, '<td valign="top">6/7/6.. 7 - Excellent coloring and contrast control.  Good title.  Criticism; may have required a slight rotation, but a crop at the bottom to lose that leg tag would have made this much better in my opinion.  Possibly also (depending what was there and what you had to work with) inclusion of more left background, not only because ''everybody'' is there seemingly, but the colors are very nice.</td>', '6/7/6.. 7 - Excellent coloring and contrast control.  Good title.  Criticism; may have required a slight rotation, but a crop at the bottom to lose that leg tag would have made this much better in my opinion.  Possibly also (depending what was there and what you had to work with) inclusion of more left background, not only because ''everybody'' is there seemingly, but the colors are very nice.', '2005-11-24 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894546, 259366, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good concept.  Criticism; a sharper angle/perspective, possibly even including more fore (even if they were out of focus), while retaining the focus on that one petal left, would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '6 - Good concept.  Criticism; a sharper angle/perspective, possibly even including more fore (even if they were out of focus), while retaining the focus on that one petal left, would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-11-24 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
