(1894660, 260908, 39675, '<td valign="top">This is very well executed.  It is almost perfect.  As you probably know the angle left arm (on the right side of the photograph) looks as though it is going behind the entire egg rather than coming out of the egg.  But, When it''s good, it''s good. 9</td>', 'This is very well executed.  It is almost perfect.  As you probably know the angle left arm (on the right side of the photograph) looks as though it is going behind the entire egg rather than coming out of the egg.  But, When it''s good, it''s good. 9', '2005-11-24 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894668, 259712, 39675, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get counted down from voters who read a book one time that states it is better to keep your subject out of the center of your photograph.  For some photographs center composition just works.  This is one of them.  I love the contrast of life and winter death.  By the way, my wife says forget the picture she wants you to pick that before the birds get it...</td>', 'I hope you don''t get counted down from voters who read a book one time that states it is better to keep your subject out of the center of your photograph.  For some photographs center composition just works.  This is one of them.  I love the contrast of life and winter death.  By the way, my wife says forget the picture she wants you to pick that before the birds get it...', '2005-11-24 02:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894672, 259638, 39675, '<td valign="top">I really like how the light is cast on the tree in the upper left hand corner.  I think it allows for the banjo to be centered in the composition.  I also like the country feel to the backdrop which makes me almost hear the stings being plucked.  Good luck</td>', 'I really like how the light is cast on the tree in the upper left hand corner.  I think it allows for the banjo to be centered in the composition.  I also like the country feel to the backdrop which makes me almost hear the stings being plucked.  Good luck', '2005-11-24 02:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894675, 260997, 39675, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that I like.  I think it is the sky and the gradient.  You kept it from getting too bright.  Good simple crop.</td>', 'There''s something about this that I like.  I think it is the sky and the gradient.  You kept it from getting too bright.  Good simple crop.', '2005-11-24 02:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894679, 261128, 39675, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good focus.  Just a clean shot.  But, I really enjoy unusual or odd shots of animals and so I have no choice  but to give you a 9.</td>', 'Nice colors, good focus.  Just a clean shot.  But, I really enjoy unusual or odd shots of animals and so I have no choice  but to give you a 9.', '2005-11-24 02:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894681, 260970, 39675, '<td valign="top">I love the shot and the reflected light on the left side of the photograph.  I would have used my crop differently though.  I would have left the negative space above the upper ball rather than below the relection.  In its current crop it gives the feeling that the balls are floating and that the laws of gravity are not at work.  Whe that is not a useful element of the photograph it makes it so that people think there is just something not quite right.  Otherwise great 6.</td>', 'I love the shot and the reflected light on the left side of the photograph.  I would have used my crop differently though.  I would have left the negative space above the upper ball rather than below the relection.  In its current crop it gives the feeling that the balls are floating and that the laws of gravity are not at work.  Whe that is not a useful element of the photograph it makes it so that people think there is just something not quite right.  Otherwise great 6.', '2005-11-24 02:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894682, 261146, 39675, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to get me a pair of those socks.  I think you''re on to something here.  Oh and by the way, nice pose, good focus and lighting and clean composition.</td>', 'I''ve got to get me a pair of those socks.  I think you''re on to something here.  Oh and by the way, nice pose, good focus and lighting and clean composition.', '2005-11-24 02:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894683, 260329, 45414, '<td valign="top">why so small</td>', 'why so small', '2005-11-24 02:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894684, 260998, 39675, '<td valign="top">The motion blure is good.  I also like how the back light works with the hat to create a glow.  I guess this classifiies for odd.  I think this site could use some creative and real photographs that are NOT snapshots, so I give you props. 7.</td>', 'The motion blure is good.  I also like how the back light works with the hat to create a glow.  I guess this classifiies for odd.  I think this site could use some creative and real photographs that are NOT snapshots, so I give you props. 7.', '2005-11-24 02:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
