(1894689, 260212, 39675, '<td valign="top">I think the expression on the girl''s face makes the shot.  Good capture.  Flowers in the upper right are just a bit distracting.  I know that can''t be control in a candid, but because this is a photo competition it has to count for something.  Still a 7.</td>', 'I think the expression on the girl''s face makes the shot.  Good capture.  Flowers in the upper right are just a bit distracting.  I know that can''t be control in a candid, but because this is a photo competition it has to count for something.  Still a 7.', '2005-11-24 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
