(1894795, 259129, 45857, '<td valign="top">Actually think its a cultural thing. I love the character in the hands, but would have like more zing to the bling.</td>', 'Actually think its a cultural thing. I love the character in the hands, but would have like more zing to the bling.', '2005-11-24 05:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
