(1894808, 259328, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have an interesting concept here. I think it would have come across better by taking a close up of the eggs, feather and nail without so much negative space and playing with the camera angle.</td>', 'You have an interesting concept here. I think it would have come across better by taking a close up of the eggs, feather and nail without so much negative space and playing with the camera angle.', '2005-11-24 05:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894809, 260264, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the picture alot. Not sure if I like the yellow tone though. Your picture deserves to do well.</td>', 'I like the picture alot. Not sure if I like the yellow tone though. Your picture deserves to do well.', '2005-11-24 05:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894813, 259110, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot, I like the composition and the contrasting type of light.<br/>I''m not sure about the title and how it fits the challenge, and even that isn''t odd for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a very good shot, I like the composition and the contrasting type of light.I''m not sure about the title and how it fits the challenge, and even that isn''t odd for this challenge.', '2005-11-24 05:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
