(1894815, 261155, 35322, '<td valign="top">hmmm....that''s a banana.....hmmm...that''s not odd</td>', 'hmmm....that''s a banana.....hmmm...that''s not odd', '2005-11-24 05:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894816, 260851, 45857, '<td valign="top">Popeye!!! Quick sell it to the Spinach Growers Association.<br/>LOL, the poor kid will never live this one down.  Great studio capture.</td>', 'Popeye!!! Quick sell it to the Spinach Growers Association.LOL, the poor kid will never live this one down.  Great studio capture.', '2005-11-24 05:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894818, 260387, 3306, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that this picture caught my attention. I can''t tell if the individual is missing a finger or if it is the lighting and shadows that make it look as if the finger is missing. If the subject of the picture is the card than the lighting is distracting because the viewers eye is drawn to the missing finger. If it is actually a missing finger on the person''s hand than you have captured the subject well.</td>', 'I have to admit that this picture caught my attention. I can''t tell if the individual is missing a finger or if it is the lighting and shadows that make it look as if the finger is missing. If the subject of the picture is the card than the lighting is distracting because the viewers eye is drawn to the missing finger. If it is actually a missing finger on the person''s hand than you have captured the subject well.', '2005-11-24 05:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894819, 261165, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2005-11-24 05:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894820, 260970, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, but the reflection of the lights is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like your composition, but the reflection of the lights is a little distracting.', '2005-11-24 06:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894821, 259929, 45857, '<td valign="top">The seldom seen Elephant Tusk Cedar, very rare.<br/>Great find, clever title, but it seems a bit over-exposed.</td>', 'The seldom seen Elephant Tusk Cedar, very rare.Great find, clever title, but it seems a bit over-exposed.', '2005-11-24 06:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894822, 260662, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best pictures in the challenge. The subject is interesting and funny. The placement of the subjects in the frame is good and the picture is well balanced. The lighting is also well done with the exception that the cone is slightly oversaturated but I do not feel that it takes away from the overall unique take on the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'This is one of the best pictures in the challenge. The subject is interesting and funny. The placement of the subjects in the frame is good and the picture is well balanced. The lighting is also well done with the exception that the cone is slightly oversaturated but I do not feel that it takes away from the overall unique take on the challenge. Good luck.', '2005-11-24 06:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894823, 260444, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has a mystical feel to it. The clouds add to that feeling. It is a well done moment in time and interesting to look at.</td>', 'This picture has a mystical feel to it. The clouds add to that feeling. It is a well done moment in time and interesting to look at.', '2005-11-24 06:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894824, 260352, 45857, '<td valign="top">This one is certainly interesting, its got a lot going on. I''m not sure if its positive or negative in some places. Wild!  Very creative.<br/></td>', 'This one is certainly interesting, its got a lot going on. I''m not sure if its positive or negative in some places. Wild!  Very creative.', '2005-11-24 06:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894825, 260965, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but picture seems dull, grayish.</td>', 'I like the idea, but picture seems dull, grayish.', '2005-11-24 06:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894826, 260615, 3306, '<td valign="top">The light is a little harsh on the model''s face and the focus is slightly off on  the upper part of the flower. Otherwise a nicely composed picture.</td>', 'The light is a little harsh on the model''s face and the focus is slightly off on  the upper part of the flower. Otherwise a nicely composed picture.', '2005-11-24 06:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894827, 261021, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative capture.</td>', 'Interesting and creative capture.', '2005-11-24 06:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894828, 259489, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good perspective on an interesting artwork.</td>', 'Good perspective on an interesting artwork.', '2005-11-24 06:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894830, 260859, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very well composed and interesting picture. The eyes of the subject are captivating and the placement of the model in all three places is nicely balanced. If this is a valid entry under the rules of the challenge it should do very well. Good job.</td>', 'This is a very well composed and interesting picture. The eyes of the subject are captivating and the placement of the model in all three places is nicely balanced. If this is a valid entry under the rules of the challenge it should do very well. Good job.', '2005-11-24 06:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894831, 260745, 45857, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t think this one shows much inspiration, I''m sure you can do better.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t think this one shows much inspiration, I''m sure you can do better.', '2005-11-24 06:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894832, 261095, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome capture. I would have like to have seen it cropped in and in focus more on the birds, the antlers, ear and eye of the bull to eliminate the distracting backround.</td>', 'This is an awesome capture. I would have like to have seen it cropped in and in focus more on the birds, the antlers, ear and eye of the bull to eliminate the distracting backround.', '2005-11-24 06:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894834, 260689, 45857, '<td valign="top">Ah, white eggs, that''s an oddity in itself. (I should refrain from commenting about other entries, sorry) The little flare off the counter in the back is annoying, but not that much.</td>', 'Ah, white eggs, that''s an oddity in itself. (I should refrain from commenting about other entries, sorry) The little flare off the counter in the back is annoying, but not that much.', '2005-11-24 06:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894840, 260859, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is strong stuff. The only weak point would be the bleed through of the eye in the front face. I even like the soft focus of the fore face, it gives depth to the image, brings the viewer into the picture.</td>', 'This is strong stuff. The only weak point would be the bleed through of the eye in the front face. I even like the soft focus of the fore face, it gives depth to the image, brings the viewer into the picture.', '2005-11-24 06:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894841, 259540, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image, with a dirty natural feel to it.</td>', 'Nice crisp image, with a dirty natural feel to it.', '2005-11-24 06:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894845, 258363, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. Looks like 8 iron from here. About 120m<br/>Photographicly, I love the play of the shadows across the fairway and the balance of items in your frame.</td>', 'I like the shot. Looks like 8 iron from here. About 120mPhotographicly, I love the play of the shadows across the fairway and the balance of items in your frame.', '2005-11-24 06:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894847, 261146, 45857, '<td valign="top">Very cute, love your fashion sense. A few spots on the backdrop, but like your composition</td>', 'Very cute, love your fashion sense. A few spots on the backdrop, but like your composition', '2005-11-24 06:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894851, 260013, 44611, '<td valign="top">Well captured - the composition is brilliant and this has a lovely serene feeling to it.</td>', 'Well captured - the composition is brilliant and this has a lovely serene feeling to it.', '2005-11-24 06:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894852, 259366, 44611, '<td valign="top">Innovative idea and well put together.  Good one.</td>', 'Innovative idea and well put together.  Good one.', '2005-11-24 06:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894853, 260346, 44611, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic colour, light and detail.  Excellent image.</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic colour, light and detail.  Excellent image.', '2005-11-24 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894855, 261020, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.</td>', 'Great abstract.', '2005-11-24 07:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894856, 258623, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fabulously put together - great composition and colour.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Fabulously put together - great composition and colour.  Beautiful.', '2005-11-24 07:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894857, 261077, 44611, '<td valign="top">Super composition and detail.  Very well thought of and put together.</td>', 'Super composition and detail.  Very well thought of and put together.', '2005-11-24 07:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894859, 259596, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued if this is possible with basic editing - if it is will someone please explain the steps.  Great idea nonetheless and very effective.</td>', 'I''m intrigued if this is possible with basic editing - if it is will someone please explain the steps.  Great idea nonetheless and very effective.', '2005-11-24 07:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894860, 259328, 44611, '<td valign="top">Please assure me that you did not steal those eggs from some bird''s nest?  Great concept though.</td>', 'Please assure me that you did not steal those eggs from some bird''s nest?  Great concept though.', '2005-11-24 07:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894861, 260643, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fabulous depth of colour in this image .. and I have not the foggiest idea what it is so, I guess that makes it rather odd.</td>', 'Fabulous depth of colour in this image .. and I have not the foggiest idea what it is so, I guess that makes it rather odd.', '2005-11-24 07:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894862, 259393, 44611, '<td valign="top">Definitely a weird effect.</td>', 'Definitely a weird effect.', '2005-11-24 07:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894863, 260206, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good detail and effect here.  I can''t help feeling though that a different colured background would have made all the difference to this shot.  Sadly the wood doesn''t contrast enough with the grey.</td>', 'Good detail and effect here.  I can''t help feeling though that a different colured background would have made all the difference to this shot.  Sadly the wood doesn''t contrast enough with the grey.', '2005-11-24 07:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894864, 259825, 44611, '<td valign="top">Laughing - I fear you may be!</td>', 'Laughing - I fear you may be!', '2005-11-24 07:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894865, 259833, 44611, '<td valign="top">Such a shame that this shot is dark, and with the exception of the main sign rather blurry.  It''s certainly odd.</td>', 'Such a shame that this shot is dark, and with the exception of the main sign rather blurry.  It''s certainly odd.', '2005-11-24 07:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894868, 258470, 44611, '<td valign="top">I feel that the lighting is far to harsh in this image - a shame because it is a good concept.</td>', 'I feel that the lighting is far to harsh in this image - a shame because it is a good concept.', '2005-11-24 07:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894870, 260851, 44611, '<td valign="top">That''s one heck of an expression.  Either he''s learnt to wink at the girls early or someone just caught his eye with the lemon juice!  Good comp and colour.</td>', 'That''s one heck of an expression.  Either he''s learnt to wink at the girls early or someone just caught his eye with the lemon juice!  Good comp and colour.', '2005-11-24 07:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894871, 259933, 45857, '<td valign="top">Certainly odd items and your composition is interesting.</td>', 'Certainly odd items and your composition is interesting.', '2005-11-24 07:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894872, 260212, 44611, '<td valign="top">There''s some great colour in this and I can see why you wanted to include the flowers, but somehow this doesn''t work for me with the heads cut off the other bodies in the image.  The little girl is an absolutely cutie though!</td>', 'There''s some great colour in this and I can see why you wanted to include the flowers, but somehow this doesn''t work for me with the heads cut off the other bodies in the image.  The little girl is an absolutely cutie though!', '2005-11-24 07:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894874, 258732, 44611, '<td valign="top">It may be my monitor granted, but the item on the left of this shot is too dark for me to make out.  Add to that the soft, distance focus on the flowers and sadly this image just hasn''t fulfilled its potential to my eyes.  I also have a hard time getting the link with odd.</td>', 'It may be my monitor granted, but the item on the left of this shot is too dark for me to make out.  Add to that the soft, distance focus on the flowers and sadly this image just hasn''t fulfilled its potential to my eyes.  I also have a hard time getting the link with odd.', '2005-11-24 07:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894876, 260214, 45316, '<td valign="top">Think it would make it better if the colours were sharper and the object were litle darker. But it''s great picture though!</td>', 'Think it would make it better if the colours were sharper and the object were litle darker. But it''s great picture though!', '2005-11-24 07:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894877, 260040, 44611, '<td valign="top">Definitely a triffid and a pretty odd thing to have in your garden.  However, this image comes across as a snapshot only.   The idea to take the plant from an unusual angle was a good one, but with the house in the background it detracts from the main subject.</td>', 'Definitely a triffid and a pretty odd thing to have in your garden.  However, this image comes across as a snapshot only.   The idea to take the plant from an unusual angle was a good one, but with the house in the background it detracts from the main subject.', '2005-11-24 07:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894879, 260352, 45316, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. Odd???</td>', 'I don''t get it. Odd???', '2005-11-24 07:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894880, 260421, 44611, '<td valign="top">This seems to be not much of anything - but possibly has a really good story to it.  Can''t get the connection with odd though.</td>', 'This seems to be not much of anything - but possibly has a really good story to it.  Can''t get the connection with odd though.', '2005-11-24 07:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894881, 261073, 44611, '<td valign="top">Nice paint job!  Creative idea.</td>', 'Nice paint job!  Creative idea.', '2005-11-24 07:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894884, 260615, 45316, '<td valign="top">Great work! The lighting, texture, colour combination and everything!! The skin of the lady is overexposured but it''s gives the picture something it would miss otherwise. The eye, her hair and the flower are the main objects in this one and it is great!!</td>', 'Great work! The lighting, texture, colour combination and everything!! The skin of the lady is overexposured but it''s gives the picture something it would miss otherwise. The eye, her hair and the flower are the main objects in this one and it is great!!', '2005-11-24 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894887, 260892, 45316, '<td valign="top">Simple but cool.</td>', 'Simple but cool.', '2005-11-24 07:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894891, 260369, 44611, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t work for me - I think it maybe one of those shots that some love and others hate.  I won''t go as far as saying I hate it, but I don''t like it much either, sorry.</td>', 'This just doesn''t work for me - I think it maybe one of those shots that some love and others hate.  I won''t go as far as saying I hate it, but I don''t like it much either, sorry.', '2005-11-24 07:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894892, 261132, 45316, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2005-11-24 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894893, 259932, 44611, '<td valign="top">Such a shame that the edges of this magnificent bonsai are cropped off.  The lighting and colour are good and it is a fascinating subject which sort of fits the challenge.</td>', 'Such a shame that the edges of this magnificent bonsai are cropped off.  The lighting and colour are good and it is a fascinating subject which sort of fits the challenge.', '2005-11-24 07:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894895, 259589, 44611, '<td valign="top">Poor, poor kitty - it looks terrified and miserable.  I hope you gave him/her a jolly good dry off and cuddle after this .  (You didn''t get kitty wet just for the shot did you?)  A fun memory snap - but nothing more I''m afraid.  The focus needs to be sharper and think about your composition more.</td>', 'Poor, poor kitty - it looks terrified and miserable.  I hope you gave him/her a jolly good dry off and cuddle after this .  (You didn''t get kitty wet just for the shot did you?)  A fun memory snap - but nothing more I''m afraid.  The focus needs to be sharper and think about your composition more.', '2005-11-24 07:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894896, 258981, 44611, '<td valign="top">The composition is too centralised to give the impact this image needs.  Detail on the shell could be sharper too.</td>', 'The composition is too centralised to give the impact this image needs.  Detail on the shell could be sharper too.', '2005-11-24 07:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894900, 258910, 44611, '<td valign="top">The foreground of this has a huge amount of potential - the sand and the metal ball are such contrasting surfaces, but I fail to see any advantage to the background.  Perhaps I''m being dim and need this explained to me.</td>', 'The foreground of this has a huge amount of potential - the sand and the metal ball are such contrasting surfaces, but I fail to see any advantage to the background.  Perhaps I''m being dim and need this explained to me.', '2005-11-24 07:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894902, 258947, 44611, '<td valign="top">The choice of background was good for this shot, but sadly that''s really where it ends.  The light bounce off the front coin is too much and none of the coins are in focus.  Also the composition is too centralised - it would have been better off to one of the sides.  Nonetheless a good concept that would benefit from practising at.</td>', 'The choice of background was good for this shot, but sadly that''s really where it ends.  The light bounce off the front coin is too much and none of the coins are in focus.  Also the composition is too centralised - it would have been better off to one of the sides.  Nonetheless a good concept that would benefit from practising at.', '2005-11-24 07:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894903, 260741, 44611, '<td valign="top">Oh, oh - I didn''t get the oddness of this on my first pass through!</td>', 'Oh, oh - I didn''t get the oddness of this on my first pass through!', '2005-11-24 07:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894908, 259484, 44611, '<td valign="top">A very brave attempt which, if you had got it spot on would have been a wow image.  Sadly there is not enough focus in the middle ground of your shot to make it work - had the five ''pods'' been closer to the foreground you might have got away with it.</td>', 'A very brave attempt which, if you had got it spot on would have been a wow image.  Sadly there is not enough focus in the middle ground of your shot to make it work - had the five ''pods'' been closer to the foreground you might have got away with it.', '2005-11-24 08:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894909, 260618, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is most definitely odd!  Such a shame you lost the focus on the top bits - are they ears?  I have not a a clue what this is so perhaps not ears - maybe they''re alien antennae!</td>', 'This is most definitely odd!  Such a shame you lost the focus on the top bits - are they ears?  I have not a a clue what this is so perhaps not ears - maybe they''re alien antennae!', '2005-11-24 08:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894911, 260997, 44611, '<td valign="top">The b &amp; w treatment adds to the moodiness of this image, but I don''t see anything ''odd'' about it I''m afraid. It''s just a tree losing it''s leaves - rather common in fact.   Good that you used an Interesting angle though.</td>', 'The b & w treatment adds to the moodiness of this image, but I don''t see anything ''odd'' about it I''m afraid. It''s just a tree losing it''s leaves - rather common in fact.   Good that you used an Interesting angle though.', '2005-11-24 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894914, 259844, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that this is still chained to the post - hence it''s oddness in that it is ''only remains.  The sad thing is I can''t make out the chain - so the impact of the humour is lost.</td>', 'I''m guessing that this is still chained to the post - hence it''s oddness in that it is ''only remains.  The sad thing is I can''t make out the chain - so the impact of the humour is lost.', '2005-11-24 08:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894918, 259827, 44611, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to have scored this higher as I''m a sucker for high contrast architechtural shots.  However, if you look at the right angle formed by the  window to the left of the shot  and compare it with the right angle of the bottom left courner of your frame, you can see that the image isn''t straight - and that reall spoils the angular effect.  If it had been way, way off you might have succeeded, but just that little bit really doesn''t work.</td>', 'I would have loved to have scored this higher as I''m a sucker for high contrast architechtural shots.  However, if you look at the right angle formed by the  window to the left of the shot  and compare it with the right angle of the bottom left courner of your frame, you can see that the image isn''t straight - and that reall spoils the angular effect.  If it had been way, way off you might have succeeded, but just that little bit really doesn''t work.', '2005-11-24 08:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894919, 260615, 30173, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it this time a little bit too bright on the model''s face? Otherwise I really like the focus on the flower, it''s looking great. The expression ofthe model is also perfect. FMO the light is disturbing a little bit.</td>', 'Isn''t it this time a little bit too bright on the model''s face? Otherwise I really like the focus on the flower, it''s looking great. The expression ofthe model is also perfect. FMO the light is disturbing a little bit.', '2005-11-24 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894920, 260692, 44611, '<td valign="top">A shame this image is so small - it''s hard to discern what you are trying to tell us.</td>', 'A shame this image is so small - it''s hard to discern what you are trying to tell us.', '2005-11-24 08:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894922, 260149, 44611, '<td valign="top">Your capture of the three grasses in the foreground is super - sadly though there is too much in the background distracting from them.  You could perhaps have cropped this a bit tighter to improved matters.</td>', 'Your capture of the three grasses in the foreground is super - sadly though there is too much in the background distracting from them.  You could perhaps have cropped this a bit tighter to improved matters.', '2005-11-24 08:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894924, 260784, 44611, '<td valign="top">What''s odd about oak leaves beinig frosty?  Now if they were palms that''d be strange.  Shame, because this is a good shot, although I think it would have been improved if you''d concentrated on just one of the seedlings.</td>', 'What''s odd about oak leaves beinig frosty?  Now if they were palms that''d be strange.  Shame, because this is a good shot, although I think it would have been improved if you''d concentrated on just one of the seedlings.', '2005-11-24 08:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894927, 261166, 44611, '<td valign="top">A good idea and definitely representing oddness.  The lighting seems good too, although it''s a shame you''ve cut off the zebra''s back - I wonder if there was a reason for that?</td>', 'A good idea and definitely representing oddness.  The lighting seems good too, although it''s a shame you''ve cut off the zebra''s back - I wonder if there was a reason for that?', '2005-11-24 08:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
