(1895319, 260595, 45857, '<td valign="top">Like the diagonal setup.</td>', 'Like the diagonal setup.', '2005-11-24 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895321, 261118, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture!  I think the competition is steep for this challenge and this does not come across as "Odd" as you might like, but it''s a GREAT picture!  Great focus and DOF.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderful picture!  I think the competition is steep for this challenge and this does not come across as "Odd" as you might like, but it''s a GREAT picture!  Great focus and DOF.  Nicely done.', '2005-11-24 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895325, 260679, 45857, '<td valign="top">" Have you seen the little piggies "<br/>Perhaps a little too much loss in the shadows.</td>', '" Have you seen the little piggies "Perhaps a little too much loss in the shadows.', '2005-11-24 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895329, 260278, 40019, '<td valign="top">How dare you enter a picture of my Grandfather!  Where did you find him?  We have been looking for him for days!  :-)   Seriously, nice picture and definitely fits the challenge well.</td>', 'How dare you enter a picture of my Grandfather!  Where did you find him?  We have been looking for him for days!  :-)   Seriously, nice picture and definitely fits the challenge well.', '2005-11-24 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895330, 260415, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this.</td>', 'I like the lines in this.', '2005-11-24 13:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895332, 258407, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry.</td>', 'Nice symmetry.', '2005-11-24 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895333, 260013, 40019, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning picture!  This should be on a card or poster somewhere.  Very nicely done and very touching.  Not sure how the voters are scoring for the "Odd" category (as in number of weirdness), but this is definitely in my top 10.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning picture!  This should be on a card or poster somewhere.  Very nicely done and very touching.  Not sure how the voters are scoring for the "Odd" category (as in number of weirdness), but this is definitely in my top 10.', '2005-11-24 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895338, 260465, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is different, and it is an odd effect.</td>', 'This is different, and it is an odd effect.', '2005-11-24 13:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895340, 261087, 40019, '<td valign="top">The blue eyes are interesting, but what really makes this picture for me is the fact that they are all looking at the camera with their heads slightly cocked in a "what''s s/he doing?"  kind of expression.  Great capture!  Good expsoure with that kind of back lighting. Nicely done.</td>', 'The blue eyes are interesting, but what really makes this picture for me is the fact that they are all looking at the camera with their heads slightly cocked in a "what''s s/he doing?"  kind of expression.  Great capture!  Good expsoure with that kind of back lighting. Nicely done.', '2005-11-24 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895344, 260761, 45857, '<td valign="top">does 2 odds make an even? Nice lighting.</td>', 'does 2 odds make an even? Nice lighting.', '2005-11-24 13:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895348, 260851, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  There are all kinds of titles that could have gone with this one - like "What''s that Odd smell?"  :-)   Good tonality and framing.  I little more light on the eyes would have been nice - but nothing to reduce my rating.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great capture!  There are all kinds of titles that could have gone with this one - like "What''s that Odd smell?"  :-)   Good tonality and framing.  I little more light on the eyes would have been nice - but nothing to reduce my rating.  Nicely done.', '2005-11-24 13:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895350, 260891, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  The lighting really makes this shot.  Good focus and DOF as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  The lighting really makes this shot.  Good focus and DOF as well. Nicely done.', '2005-11-24 13:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895352, 259933, 40019, '<td valign="top">That is truly odd.  Nice framing and composition (including the tree and sky). Nice rich colors as well.</td>', 'That is truly odd.  Nice framing and composition (including the tree and sky). Nice rich colors as well.', '2005-11-24 13:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895362, 260703, 45857, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but your image just doesn''t excite me, too many things are OOF.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but your image just doesn''t excite me, too many things are OOF.', '2005-11-24 13:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895371, 260681, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet capture, I can remember this kind of joy and excitement form my own kids.</td>', 'This is a sweet capture, I can remember this kind of joy and excitement form my own kids.', '2005-11-24 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
