(1895921, 260625, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Odd indeed.  This building really strikes me.  I love the blues and the . . .well. . .odd display of squares everywhere.  And it''s very well taken.  The composition, the focus.   I like it the more I look at it!   Well done!!!   10</td>', 'Yes!  Odd indeed.  This building really strikes me.  I love the blues and the . . .well. . .odd display of squares everywhere.  And it''s very well taken.  The composition, the focus.   I like it the more I look at it!   Well done!!!   10', '2005-11-24 20:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895924, 260013, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man. . .this is by far one of my top "ribbon 3" in this challenge.   If you end up on the podium with millions of well-wishers at the end, remember, I said it first! ,  My call for one of the ribbons  :)   Good luck!    It certainly deserves one!  10<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh man. . .this is by far one of my top "ribbon 3" in this challenge.   If you end up on the podium with millions of well-wishers at the end, remember, I said it first! ,  My call for one of the ribbons  :)   Good luck!    It certainly deserves one!  10 ', '2005-11-24 20:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1895927, 259978, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww. . . that is my FAVORITE kind of duck!   Don''t you just love how innocent and . . .well. . ."duck" like they are when they are just floating around, or just begging you for food. . .but then they take to flight, and they are the most beautiful creatures God ever created!   I love how this photo shows so well all their colors -- and even the crystal clear water to show his paddling little feet.   Good luck!</td>', 'Awwwwww. . . that is my FAVORITE kind of duck!   Don''t you just love how innocent and . . .well. . ."duck" like they are when they are just floating around, or just begging you for food. . .but then they take to flight, and they are the most beautiful creatures God ever created!   I love how this photo shows so well all their colors -- and even the crystal clear water to show his paddling little feet.   Good luck!', '2005-11-24 20:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
