(1896125, 260662, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Criticism; maybe a slightly tighter crop at the fore, giving the ''cone'' more height may have made this better in my opinion.  Maybe also aiming for more ''symmetry'' overall compositionally, not sure.  It''s dark, but I think that adds an element to this that helps it.  Not sure on the thick frame.</td>', '7 - Good.  Criticism; maybe a slightly tighter crop at the fore, giving the ''cone'' more height may have made this better in my opinion.  Maybe also aiming for more ''symmetry'' overall compositionally, not sure.  It''s dark, but I think that adds an element to this that helps it.  Not sure on the thick frame.', '2005-11-24 23:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896140, 260013, 29906, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best shots in this challenge, excellent is every aspect, definetely a 10, I hope you get a ribbon.</td>', 'This is one of the best shots in this challenge, excellent is every aspect, definetely a 10, I hope you get a ribbon.', '2005-11-24 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896149, 261095, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good.  Two for one.  Criticism; not much, maybe slightly tighter crop, with the birds top right and the face more centered, may have made this even better, not sure.</td>', '8 - Good.  Two for one.  Criticism; not much, maybe slightly tighter crop, with the birds top right and the face more centered, may have made this even better, not sure.', '2005-11-24 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
