(1896163, 259328, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like it.  Criticism; maybe not so much ''space'', or else slightly off centered, not sure.  A little sharper focus/definition, ideally on both the eggs and nails, but even one or the other, would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the white background, works but, a little ''sterile'' or ''empty'' type of feel in my opinion. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-01 05:20:26.</i></td>', '8 - Like it.  Criticism; maybe not so much ''space'', or else slightly off centered, not sure.  A little sharper focus/definition, ideally on both the eggs and nails, but even one or the other, would have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the white background, works but, a little ''sterile'' or ''empty'' type of feel in my opinion. edit:typo', '2005-11-24 23:39:53.000000', '2005-12-01 05:20:26.000000', 1),
(1896165, 259360, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this and good set up.  Criticism; not much, maybe some type of small lighting for added effect would have made this even better.  Maybe a slight crop change, especially to eliminate that whiteish mark fore right.</td>', '8 - Like this and good set up.  Criticism; not much, maybe some type of small lighting for added effect would have made this even better.  Maybe a slight crop change, especially to eliminate that whiteish mark fore right.', '2005-11-24 23:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896168, 261165, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this, makes you ''think''.  Criticism; no expert on moon shots but seems you have done well to capture the silhouette(?) of the plane and still retain the detail you have in the moon.  Maybe a tweaking of colors to get some added effect here would have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Like this, makes you ''think''.  Criticism; no expert on moon shots but seems you have done well to capture the silhouette(?) of the plane and still retain the detail you have in the moon.  Maybe a tweaking of colors to get some added effect here would have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-11-24 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896170, 261087, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this, as odd as those eyes are, which obviously enhances (or should) for the Challenge.  Criticism; slightly sharper fore focus perhaps, as is on the lambs'' bodies.  Dependent what you had to work with and what is there, possibly an inclusion of more on the left may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Like this, as odd as those eyes are, which obviously enhances (or should) for the Challenge.  Criticism; slightly sharper fore focus perhaps, as is on the lambs'' bodies.  Dependent what you had to work with and what is there, possibly an inclusion of more on the left may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-24 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896177, 259484, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Really like this and the effect with the depth of field.  Nice colors.  Criticism; difficult, as you''re obviously ''accentuating'' the five stamens, and camera dependent, but like to see those nice and detailed.  Good composition/placement too.</td>', '7 - Really like this and the effect with the depth of field.  Nice colors.  Criticism; difficult, as you''re obviously ''accentuating'' the five stamens, and camera dependent, but like to see those nice and detailed.  Good composition/placement too.', '2005-11-24 23:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896180, 259363, 46020, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this.  It looks like it belongs in an aquarium.  Good job, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this.  It looks like it belongs in an aquarium.  Good job, good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-24 23:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896195, 260568, 46020, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Wish there was more DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Wish there was more DOF.', '2005-11-25 00:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
