(1896209, 261165, 46020, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Wish I could give you an 11!  I would buy a print of this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'WOW.  Wish I could give you an 11!  I would buy a print of this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-25 00:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896211, 259679, 46020, '<td valign="top">Cool pic!</td>', 'Cool pic!', '2005-11-25 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896225, 258363, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m not a golf player, and I try not to judge for the title. Stil, the title doesn''t help very much. The course looks good though. So personally I''m not sure where the odds are. I gave it a 3 because I didn''t get your concept in this shot. The focus doesn''t look where it''s supposed to be pointed. Sorry, this shot confused me a lot.</td>', 'I''m not a golf player, and I try not to judge for the title. Stil, the title doesn''t help very much. The course looks good though. So personally I''m not sure where the odds are. I gave it a 3 because I didn''t get your concept in this shot. The focus doesn''t look where it''s supposed to be pointed. Sorry, this shot confused me a lot.', '2005-11-25 00:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896226, 259393, 45961, '<td valign="top">This looks very much like a random night shot and lots of fooling around with the camera. I did that too when I knew my camera could take long exposure shots. Personally, I don''t think it''s a great shot so I gave it a 3. One thing intriguing about his shot is that it makes me wonder where it''s shot. Perhaps if this was a little more composed it could have gained higher points.</td>', 'This looks very much like a random night shot and lots of fooling around with the camera. I did that too when I knew my camera could take long exposure shots. Personally, I don''t think it''s a great shot so I gave it a 3. One thing intriguing about his shot is that it makes me wonder where it''s shot. Perhaps if this was a little more composed it could have gained higher points.', '2005-11-25 00:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896228, 259612, 45961, '<td valign="top">I don''t find any odd in this photo, could be because my dad drinks beer quite often so I''d see this seen in the fridge very often. Even the numbers of can shown isn''t odd. It doesn''t seem to fit the challenge to me, so I gave this a 3.</td>', 'I don''t find any odd in this photo, could be because my dad drinks beer quite often so I''d see this seen in the fridge very often. Even the numbers of can shown isn''t odd. It doesn''t seem to fit the challenge to me, so I gave this a 3.', '2005-11-25 00:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896231, 261117, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m confused on this shot, I can''t see what''s odd with the shot, so I gave it a 3 because it looks like it''s a picture placed in the wrong challenge. Giving credit to the title, perhaps for me seeing these kind of scenery is common to me so it''s not odd. It''s a nice picture though, but I think it''s a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I''m confused on this shot, I can''t see what''s odd with the shot, so I gave it a 3 because it looks like it''s a picture placed in the wrong challenge. Giving credit to the title, perhaps for me seeing these kind of scenery is common to me so it''s not odd. It''s a nice picture though, but I think it''s a bit out of focus.', '2005-11-25 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896235, 260966, 45961, '<td valign="top">A very random picture to me. This is exactly what I do with my friends when we see a mirror in the toilet or someone''s bedroom. I''m not sure what your "odd" element is here. Because of that I gave you a 3. I''d say for a better shot, trying cleaning the mirror so it becomes streak-free and no finger grease.</td>', 'A very random picture to me. This is exactly what I do with my friends when we see a mirror in the toilet or someone''s bedroom. I''m not sure what your "odd" element is here. Because of that I gave you a 3. I''d say for a better shot, trying cleaning the mirror so it becomes streak-free and no finger grease.', '2005-11-25 00:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896237, 260957, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s the "odd" element here. Is it because the model is happy? Or the thumbs up? Or just because she''s there. I gave it a 3 because of the uncertainty in the shot. I could be wrong and not be observative enough though. I do like the focus on the model though, looks good on her.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s the "odd" element here. Is it because the model is happy? Or the thumbs up? Or just because she''s there. I gave it a 3 because of the uncertainty in the shot. I could be wrong and not be observative enough though. I do like the focus on the model though, looks good on her.', '2005-11-25 01:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896239, 259894, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you''re trying to focus on, the ears or earring. I believe it''s the earring, but how the focus is on the shot it''s more like the ear hole. I gave this a 4 because it fit the theme, it was odd by the ear and earring.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you''re trying to focus on, the ears or earring. I believe it''s the earring, but how the focus is on the shot it''s more like the ear hole. I gave this a 4 because it fit the theme, it was odd by the ear and earring.', '2005-11-25 01:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896241, 261009, 45961, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 4 because it showed too much couch. Perhaps you could have zoomed in on the model or moved closer to have more of the kid. It''s a cute picture though and certainly fun doing the pretzel move. It''s a good shot, but to me, it''s not great. Sorry.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 4 because it showed too much couch. Perhaps you could have zoomed in on the model or moved closer to have more of the kid. It''s a cute picture though and certainly fun doing the pretzel move. It''s a good shot, but to me, it''s not great. Sorry.', '2005-11-25 01:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896244, 260821, 45961, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely odd, but it''s not odd enough, so I gave this one a 4. It''s a cute picture, but there''s something missing within the shot. I can''t pin point what it is, but my gut says it''s probably the angle. I could be totally off. Great effort though, love the dinosaur creativity!</td>', 'It''s definitely odd, but it''s not odd enough, so I gave this one a 4. It''s a cute picture, but there''s something missing within the shot. I can''t pin point what it is, but my gut says it''s probably the angle. I could be totally off. Great effort though, love the dinosaur creativity!', '2005-11-25 01:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896246, 259139, 45961, '<td valign="top">This got a 4 because it was grainy. The fungi stands out amounst the others because of it''s size, but there''s something not quite right in the shot. Perhaps the colour version of this picture could have been better?</td>', 'This got a 4 because it was grainy. The fungi stands out amounst the others because of it''s size, but there''s something not quite right in the shot. Perhaps the colour version of this picture could have been better?', '2005-11-25 01:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896248, 258407, 45961, '<td valign="top">Creative and certainly not seen in other entries. I personally don''t think it''s a great shot so I threw a 4 on this shot because it''s too plain. I''m not sure if you''ve did it on purpose, but during the long exposure to the light, the camera moved so it has a bit of a slant to the circular light. More focus, might have done better as well.</td>', 'Creative and certainly not seen in other entries. I personally don''t think it''s a great shot so I threw a 4 on this shot because it''s too plain. I''m not sure if you''ve did it on purpose, but during the long exposure to the light, the camera moved so it has a bit of a slant to the circular light. More focus, might have done better as well.', '2005-11-25 01:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896251, 260716, 45961, '<td valign="top">I don''t exactly find the fashion sense odd, but it''s probably because I do go out like this rather often. So to others it may be odd. I considered this as theme fitting so I gave a 4. Perhaps if the toe socks were placed in a better background it would have earned more points.</td>', 'I don''t exactly find the fashion sense odd, but it''s probably because I do go out like this rather often. So to others it may be odd. I considered this as theme fitting so I gave a 4. Perhaps if the toe socks were placed in a better background it would have earned more points.', '2005-11-25 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896253, 259589, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s definitely odd, but the light is a bit distracting, and the focus could be better. Keep trying. :)</td>', 'That''s definitely odd, but the light is a bit distracting, and the focus could be better. Keep trying. :)', '2005-11-25 01:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896254, 260590, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo, but it is grainy. :(</td>', 'This is a cute photo, but it is grainy. :(', '2005-11-25 01:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896255, 259997, 45961, '<td valign="top">Great thought, but because a lot of other people used dice in their shots this one lacks the ingenuity in it. The background it quite place and it doesn''t show off the dice very much. I like the thougt of stacking up the odds though. There''s also too much like on the top die.</td>', 'Great thought, but because a lot of other people used dice in their shots this one lacks the ingenuity in it. The background it quite place and it doesn''t show off the dice very much. I like the thougt of stacking up the odds though. There''s also too much like on the top die.', '2005-11-25 01:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896256, 259738, 47487, '<td valign="top">Well-shot.</td>', 'Well-shot.', '2005-11-25 01:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896258, 259373, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s very pretty.</td>', 'That''s very pretty.', '2005-11-25 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896261, 258461, 45961, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure if I was going to fit this as theme fitting or not, so it was lingering between a 3 and 4. I gave a 4 because if viewed through someone else''s eyes it may be odd. This looks more like a courting ritual between two dogs rather than a fight off. Honestly, I don''t think it''s a great shot, because it lacks certain vibrant colours to highlight the scene. The shot is too cold, if you could give it a warmer feel, it would have been better.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure if I was going to fit this as theme fitting or not, so it was lingering between a 3 and 4. I gave a 4 because if viewed through someone else''s eyes it may be odd. This looks more like a courting ritual between two dogs rather than a fight off. Honestly, I don''t think it''s a great shot, because it lacks certain vibrant colours to highlight the scene. The shot is too cold, if you could give it a warmer feel, it would have been better.', '2005-11-25 01:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896263, 259530, 47487, '<td valign="top">Is a bit grainy. Interesting idea; would maybe have been a bit better if you''d selected something that fit in the carton.</td>', 'Is a bit grainy. Interesting idea; would maybe have been a bit better if you''d selected something that fit in the carton.', '2005-11-25 01:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896267, 260329, 45961, '<td valign="top">Wow, the picture is small, so I gave an odd theme for that, but it also gave it a 4 because it was partially too small. The picture is grainy, even if it''s small. The lack of clarity in the bird''s details was why I gave you a very low number.</td>', 'Wow, the picture is small, so I gave an odd theme for that, but it also gave it a 4 because it was partially too small. The picture is grainy, even if it''s small. The lack of clarity in the bird''s details was why I gave you a very low number.', '2005-11-25 01:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896268, 260801, 47487, '<td valign="top">Is that a reflection in a window? A polarizing filter would have helped with that.</td>', 'Is that a reflection in a window? A polarizing filter would have helped with that.', '2005-11-25 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896269, 261146, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s a cute idea!  Well-photographed, as well.</td>', 'That''s a cute idea!  Well-photographed, as well.', '2005-11-25 01:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896271, 261138, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m not certain what''s odd here, but I''ll consider an odd picture because of the unusual angle compared to the rest of the other shots submitted in the challenge. For that I gave a 4 though because it lacks a certain mood in the picture.</td>', 'I''m not certain what''s odd here, but I''ll consider an odd picture because of the unusual angle compared to the rest of the other shots submitted in the challenge. For that I gave a 4 though because it lacks a certain mood in the picture.', '2005-11-25 01:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896273, 261087, 47487, '<td valign="top">Could have run in Even too, almost. :) The symmetry of the lambs is fantastic.</td>', 'Could have run in Even too, almost. :) The symmetry of the lambs is fantastic.', '2005-11-25 01:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896275, 260490, 45961, '<td valign="top">This picture got a 4 because it''s very grainy, especially compared to all of the other pictures. The clarity isn''t good at all. Silhouette doesn''t workd very well of this dragonfly. Well, at least you can still see it''s a dragonfly. It was creative of you to rotate the picture (I''m assuming you rotated it).</td>', 'This picture got a 4 because it''s very grainy, especially compared to all of the other pictures. The clarity isn''t good at all. Silhouette doesn''t workd very well of this dragonfly. Well, at least you can still see it''s a dragonfly. It was creative of you to rotate the picture (I''m assuming you rotated it).', '2005-11-25 01:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896276, 261093, 47487, '<td valign="top">Just as a photo, I like this. I think you stretched a bit to reach the theme.</td>', 'Just as a photo, I like this. I think you stretched a bit to reach the theme.', '2005-11-25 01:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896277, 259530, 45961, '<td valign="top">The focus wasn''t a very well done job on this shot, I originally gave it a 5, but have to drop it down to a 4 because of that. It''s an innovative thought compared to other egg users. The cloth used as a background doesn''t work very well for the picture, in my opinion. It needs something that will contrast the container colour. It could have turned out a better shot. That''s what I think at least.</td>', 'The focus wasn''t a very well done job on this shot, I originally gave it a 5, but have to drop it down to a 4 because of that. It''s an innovative thought compared to other egg users. The cloth used as a background doesn''t work very well for the picture, in my opinion. It needs something that will contrast the container colour. It could have turned out a better shot. That''s what I think at least.', '2005-11-25 01:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896278, 259147, 48560, '<td valign="top">librodo?<br/> <br/>UPDATE: This looks so much like another photographer''s usual style, and thus the earlier comment, hope you are not offended. It''s actually a compliment. I find this photo having good technicals - it''s sharp, the good use of DOF, the colours, and the cropping. The expression on the boy is also priceless, really makes the viewer feel the happiness from whatever the boy is playing at the time. good work<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-18 00:14:44.</i></td>', 'librodo? UPDATE: This looks so much like another photographer''s usual style, and thus the earlier comment, hope you are not offended. It''s actually a compliment. I find this photo having good technicals - it''s sharp, the good use of DOF, the colours, and the cropping. The expression on the boy is also priceless, really makes the viewer feel the happiness from whatever the boy is playing at the time. good work', '2005-11-25 01:23:32.000000', '2006-05-18 01:14:44.000000', 1),
(1896279, 259892, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but a few nitpicks: 1) there''s a sign growing out of the top of the car. 2) the front of the vehicle looks a little pixelated and 3)my eye is drawn to the graffiti, so that''s a bit of a distraction. Still. I LOVE the coors in this shot, and like I said, you had a good idea.</td>', 'I like your idea, but a few nitpicks: 1) there''s a sign growing out of the top of the car. 2) the front of the vehicle looks a little pixelated and 3)my eye is drawn to the graffiti, so that''s a bit of a distraction. Still. I LOVE the coors in this shot, and like I said, you had a good idea.', '2005-11-25 01:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896280, 261155, 45961, '<td valign="top">The bruised banana peel doesn''t work so well on this shot. There''s a good focus, but it lacks something else. Too plain so to speak. So I gave it a 4 for shot creativity. Fairly decent macro shotting. At first, I really thought it was odd because I couldn''t figure out what it was. I thought it was a weird,fucnky mushroom, but now I''m pretty sure it''s a banana.</td>', 'The bruised banana peel doesn''t work so well on this shot. There''s a good focus, but it lacks something else. Too plain so to speak. So I gave it a 4 for shot creativity. Fairly decent macro shotting. At first, I really thought it was odd because I couldn''t figure out what it was. I thought it was a weird,fucnky mushroom, but now I''m pretty sure it''s a banana.', '2005-11-25 01:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896281, 260821, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s not a bad picture other than the blown highlights, but one gets the feeling that you tried a little too hard...</td>', 'It''s not a bad picture other than the blown highlights, but one gets the feeling that you tried a little too hard...', '2005-11-25 01:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896282, 261109, 47487, '<td valign="top">eew creepy. well-shot, though. now I must get it off my screen. ack. :)</td>', 'eew creepy. well-shot, though. now I must get it off my screen. ack. :)', '2005-11-25 01:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896283, 258947, 45961, '<td valign="top">The shot is quite blurry, and there''s too much light on the bottom coin, so I gave a 4 on this. The table doesn''t work well as a background, and also because it reflects light. It might have turned out better if placed on a cloth with a lighter colour that doesn''t seem to blend in with the coin colour.</td>', 'The shot is quite blurry, and there''s too much light on the bottom coin, so I gave a 4 on this. The table doesn''t work well as a background, and also because it reflects light. It might have turned out better if placed on a cloth with a lighter colour that doesn''t seem to blend in with the coin colour.', '2005-11-25 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896284, 260264, 48560, '<td valign="top">Good photo. You might wish to try turning this into a high-key image, which I personally think may strike a higher score than a soft one. Just a suggestion. The fisherman really stood out from the rest of the photo. Good job.</td>', 'Good photo. You might wish to try turning this into a high-key image, which I personally think may strike a higher score than a soft one. Just a suggestion. The fisherman really stood out from the rest of the photo. Good job.', '2005-11-25 01:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896285, 260346, 47487, '<td valign="top">ooh, I like your lighting. The bit of backlighting and the way it makes the stem glow a bit is very pretty.  I think maybe a crop to eliminate the leaves would have made the photo more striking, but even as it is, I really like it.</td>', 'ooh, I like your lighting. The bit of backlighting and the way it makes the stem glow a bit is very pretty.  I think maybe a crop to eliminate the leaves would have made the photo more striking, but even as it is, I really like it.', '2005-11-25 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896286, 260883, 48560, '<td valign="top">Amazing. Definately one of those photos that makes me go "wow". A long exposure shot? Maybe that explains the over exposed warm lights to the right. But not really something to worry too much about, since most viewers attention would be directed to the red house at the far end of the road. Good leading lines.</td>', 'Amazing. Definately one of those photos that makes me go "wow". A long exposure shot? Maybe that explains the over exposed warm lights to the right. But not really something to worry too much about, since most viewers attention would be directed to the red house at the far end of the road. Good leading lines.', '2005-11-25 01:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896287, 260894, 45961, '<td valign="top">The clarity and focus is great on this. I gave it a 4 though because it lacks the attention drawing mechanism. It''s not eye catching, the whole scene blends into each other too much. There should be more contrasting colours so it outlines the scene a bit better.</td>', 'The clarity and focus is great on this. I gave it a 4 though because it lacks the attention drawing mechanism. It''s not eye catching, the whole scene blends into each other too much. There should be more contrasting colours so it outlines the scene a bit better.', '2005-11-25 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896288, 260998, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure how this photo is odd. I''m thinking it''s because one model is moving like crazy, while the other is still. So I gave it a 4. The lighting isn''t fantastic as well. Interesting location though.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure how this photo is odd. I''m thinking it''s because one model is moving like crazy, while the other is still. So I gave it a 4. The lighting isn''t fantastic as well. Interesting location though.', '2005-11-25 01:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896292, 260891, 45961, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very well used in this shot to highlight the orange in an egg shell. I''d give this a 10, but I took a point off because the orange looks too stuffed in. Perhaps it might have been better if the whole container were stuck together instead of being broken apart somewhere around the middle. I could be wrong, and you''ve tried it and it might not look good. None the less, very innovative egg shot.</td>', 'Lighting is very well used in this shot to highlight the orange in an egg shell. I''d give this a 10, but I took a point off because the orange looks too stuffed in. Perhaps it might have been better if the whole container were stuck together instead of being broken apart somewhere around the middle. I could be wrong, and you''ve tried it and it might not look good. None the less, very innovative egg shot.', '2005-11-25 01:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896295, 259360, 45961, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is the best shot out of the whole lot. No one else used the same idea you have so creavity and innovation is very well used in this. Plus it has that eye catching element. The shot was taken in a pretty decent angle. I took a point off because the plant looks desolated, and the elephant decoration looks too big in proportion to the picture. Excellent work though!</td>', 'In my opinion, this is the best shot out of the whole lot. No one else used the same idea you have so creavity and innovation is very well used in this. Plus it has that eye catching element. The shot was taken in a pretty decent angle. I took a point off because the plant looks desolated, and the elephant decoration looks too big in proportion to the picture. Excellent work though!', '2005-11-25 01:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896296, 260939, 45961, '<td valign="top">A very clear shot. Focus and natural lighting is very well used in this. I''m not sure if it helps, but it might have looked a bit better if that foot wasn''t cut out of the frame. Creativity works well in this, you should have used a real person to give it an extra emphasis. So I gave a 9 because rim of the pants show too much and gives away quite a lot of the picture.</td>', 'A very clear shot. Focus and natural lighting is very well used in this. I''m not sure if it helps, but it might have looked a bit better if that foot wasn''t cut out of the frame. Creativity works well in this, you should have used a real person to give it an extra emphasis. So I gave a 9 because rim of the pants show too much and gives away quite a lot of the picture.', '2005-11-25 01:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896301, 260465, 45961, '<td valign="top">This is the only dice shot I gave a 7 on, it''s the highest I''ve given to a dice shot.  You''ve got very interesting dice. Uncommon, well here it is. The way you''ve cropped the picture with a feathering effect doesn''t work very well though. Odd dice is all I can say. Oh and the frames you''ve used doesn''t work very well with the lime yellow background.</td>', 'This is the only dice shot I gave a 7 on, it''s the highest I''ve given to a dice shot.  You''ve got very interesting dice. Uncommon, well here it is. The way you''ve cropped the picture with a feathering effect doesn''t work very well though. Odd dice is all I can say. Oh and the frames you''ve used doesn''t work very well with the lime yellow background.', '2005-11-25 01:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896348, 261020, 42392, '<td valign="top">this is different-i love this-great shot=10</td>', 'this is different-i love this-great shot=10', '2005-11-25 03:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896362, 260637, 45961, '<td valign="top">This is definitely Thailand, but because I live in Bangkok, this picture isn''t odd to me. The worst case was about 7 on a motorbike. I was riding on that one. So I gave this a 5 because for others it will probably be odd to them. This fits the theme nicely to foreign eyes. Well done on the panning, but the background is more focused than the actually model being taken.</td>', 'This is definitely Thailand, but because I live in Bangkok, this picture isn''t odd to me. The worst case was about 7 on a motorbike. I was riding on that one. So I gave this a 5 because for others it will probably be odd to them. This fits the theme nicely to foreign eyes. Well done on the panning, but the background is more focused than the actually model being taken.', '2005-11-25 04:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896363, 260952, 45961, '<td valign="top">Personally I don''t find the electricity distribution odd at all. Then again, if you''ve lived in fully urbanised cities with underground electrical wiring, it must be odd seeing it above ground. I live in Bangkok, so that type of electrical distribution is very common to me. I gave you a 5 because I tried not to take it through my eyes and the sunset/rise is stunning! The shot is quite pixelated though, had to take some points of there. Sorry. It''s a good shot though.</td>', 'Personally I don''t find the electricity distribution odd at all. Then again, if you''ve lived in fully urbanised cities with underground electrical wiring, it must be odd seeing it above ground. I live in Bangkok, so that type of electrical distribution is very common to me. I gave you a 5 because I tried not to take it through my eyes and the sunset/rise is stunning! The shot is quite pixelated though, had to take some points of there. Sorry. It''s a good shot though.', '2005-11-25 04:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896404, 258444, 45857, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how this fits odd, 2 hands, 2 legs. The effect is something I''ve seen before, so not really different or odd. If you think its odd, then ok.<br/>One of the rare instances where I''m giving a good score just because I like it.<br/>Shhhhh.</td>', 'Not really sure how this fits odd, 2 hands, 2 legs. The effect is something I''ve seen before, so not really different or odd. If you think its odd, then ok.One of the rare instances where I''m giving a good score just because I like it.Shhhhh.', '2005-11-25 07:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896408, 260212, 45857, '<td valign="top">Kid is at the wrong wedding, right?<br/>I think this is a fine example of the topic on many levels.<br/></td>', 'Kid is at the wrong wedding, right?I think this is a fine example of the topic on many levels.', '2005-11-25 07:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896410, 259596, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like it, certainly an original interpretation.</td>', 'I like it, certainly an original interpretation.', '2005-11-25 07:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896413, 260821, 45857, '<td valign="top">If odd can mean I don''t really understand what''s going on, you win. I do like the excitement of the moment.</td>', 'If odd can mean I don''t really understand what''s going on, you win. I do like the excitement of the moment.', '2005-11-25 07:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896414, 259470, 45857, '<td valign="top">See the blue boat....I wonder who has more fun with their boat.<br/>Good shot, right on topic.</td>', 'See the blue boat....I wonder who has more fun with their boat.Good shot, right on topic.', '2005-11-25 07:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896415, 258940, 47327, '<td valign="top">Great composition !!!<br/>I like the way you make the walls alive ...<br/>Congrats.<br/>Silvie</td>', 'Great composition !!!I like the way you make the walls alive ...Congrats.Silvie', '2005-11-25 07:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896416, 260893, 45857, '<td valign="top">If you used softer lighting it would of helped conceal some of her complexion problems (just kidding) Nice simple approach, one is odd at its most basic level.</td>', 'If you used softer lighting it would of helped conceal some of her complexion problems (just kidding) Nice simple approach, one is odd at its most basic level.', '2005-11-25 07:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896421, 261138, 45857, '<td valign="top">certainly demonstrates a brillant imagination, but I''m not sure that''s so "odd" in this crowd.</td>', 'certainly demonstrates a brillant imagination, but I''m not sure that''s so "odd" in this crowd.', '2005-11-25 07:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896425, 259982, 45857, '<td valign="top">ok, one eye, but that''s kind of a normal perspective for a bird. I do like the detail you''ve gotten in this shot. Hopefully you have shared some good technical info about what went into getting the picture.</td>', 'ok, one eye, but that''s kind of a normal perspective for a bird. I do like the detail you''ve gotten in this shot. Hopefully you have shared some good technical info about what went into getting the picture.', '2005-11-25 07:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896427, 259328, 45961, '<td valign="top">I thought this shot was very well thought out. If you hadn''t separated some of the nail bits from the nest look-a-like, it would take a lot more time to come up with what it was. A very odd nest it is. The white background works very well with the rusted nails, giving it a good contrast. The feather added for effect is very innovative as well. I gave an 8 for this shot. Not because it''s not an awesome shot, but compared to a very few others it''s lacking a few more eye catching element. The background, like I''ve said works well, but looking at it for a while, makes me think it''s too much white.</td>', 'I thought this shot was very well thought out. If you hadn''t separated some of the nail bits from the nest look-a-like, it would take a lot more time to come up with what it was. A very odd nest it is. The white background works very well with the rusted nails, giving it a good contrast. The feather added for effect is very innovative as well. I gave an 8 for this shot. Not because it''s not an awesome shot, but compared to a very few others it''s lacking a few more eye catching element. The background, like I''ve said works well, but looking at it for a while, makes me think it''s too much white.', '2005-11-25 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896428, 258947, 45857, '<td valign="top">Your symmetry is good, focus could have been better. I''m not sure about the glare on the one coin, it is distracting, but it also makes the coin distinctive again making it odd or different from the rest. I think a cooler WB would have helped here too.</td>', 'Your symmetry is good, focus could have been better. I''m not sure about the glare on the one coin, it is distracting, but it also makes the coin distinctive again making it odd or different from the rest. I think a cooler WB would have helped here too.', '2005-11-25 07:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896475, 260106, 42170, '<td valign="top">Something different, well done!</td>', 'Something different, well done!', '2005-11-25 08:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896540, 260859, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like this image. your lighting and poses are dramtic. I''ll be interested in seeing how you achieved this in basic editing.</td>', 'I like this image. your lighting and poses are dramtic. I''ll be interested in seeing how you achieved this in basic editing.', '2005-11-25 09:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896542, 259892, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice saturated colors. it really makes the car pop.</td>', 'nice saturated colors. it really makes the car pop.', '2005-11-25 09:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896544, 261146, 8624, '<td valign="top">the mixed socks are fun and your pose is playful. too bad about the spots on the ground.</td>', 'the mixed socks are fun and your pose is playful. too bad about the spots on the ground.', '2005-11-25 09:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896549, 260965, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice repetition of patterns. I think this is pretty underexposed though. would be more dramatic with brighter whites.</td>', 'nice repetition of patterns. I think this is pretty underexposed though. would be more dramatic with brighter whites.', '2005-11-25 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896550, 260630, 8624, '<td valign="top">definitely odd.</td>', 'definitely odd.', '2005-11-25 09:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896555, 261156, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice minimalist image. good lighting. I think the die, lower in the frame would have balanced the image better.</td>', 'nice minimalist image. good lighting. I think the die, lower in the frame would have balanced the image better.', '2005-11-25 09:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896558, 260662, 18191, '<td valign="top">Spectacular tones, composition, and juxtaposition! Superb!</td>', 'Spectacular tones, composition, and juxtaposition! Superb!', '2005-11-25 09:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
