(1897312, 260766, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but I think if would have been better if: 1) you''d gone in a bit tighter, or used more coins, so that the table didn''t show, and 2) you''d picked through your change jar to find coins that were either all shiny or all dull. The differences among the pennies make it where the quarter stands out less.</td>', 'I like your idea, but I think if would have been better if: 1) you''d gone in a bit tighter, or used more coins, so that the table didn''t show, and 2) you''d picked through your change jar to find coins that were either all shiny or all dull. The differences among the pennies make it where the quarter stands out less.', '2005-11-25 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897395, 260883, 41746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like this a lot. Great capture, colors and texture excellent. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful. I like this a lot. Great capture, colors and texture excellent. 10.', '2005-11-25 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897569, 259110, 44963, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Your use of light on the building, the natural light of the moon and the interaction of clouds and tree branches all add to a stunning photograph.  As with many images in this challenge I bow to your (the photographer''s) interpretation of ''odd''.  Thanks for the image.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Your use of light on the building, the natural light of the moon and the interaction of clouds and tree branches all add to a stunning photograph.  As with many images in this challenge I bow to your (the photographer''s) interpretation of ''odd''.  Thanks for the image.', '2005-11-25 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
