(1897871, 259892, 29269, '<td valign="top">2CV ! I used to have this car... the loveliest one to find. But...<br/>Its placement in the photo does not make it odd. Therefore, if you planned that the Citroen by itself is the odd one, you could have filled the frame with it for better effect. This way it looks too cluttered.</td>', '2CV ! I used to have this car... the loveliest one to find. But...Its placement in the photo does not make it odd. Therefore, if you planned that the Citroen by itself is the odd one, you could have filled the frame with it for better effect. This way it looks too cluttered.', '2005-11-26 01:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
