(1902234, 260883, 45832, '<td valign="top">original comment: (cool shot, even if it isn''t lightning.  Doesn''t strike me as odd, though.)  I mis-read it.  I thought it said "lightning."  Surreal, gorgeous.  It looks like a trail of sparks.  Is it just the light hitting the snow on the right side of the road?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-01 08:15:10.</i></td>', 'original comment: (cool shot, even if it isn''t lightning.  Doesn''t strike me as odd, though.)  I mis-read it.  I thought it said "lightning."  Surreal, gorgeous.  It looks like a trail of sparks.  Is it just the light hitting the snow on the right side of the road?', '2005-11-28 13:20:27.000000', '2005-12-01 08:15:10.000000', 1),
