(1902854, 260662, 19066, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Perhaps a tad bit oversharpened, but otherwise technically well done -- and it made me smile, which is a big plus!</td>', 'I love it.  Perhaps a tad bit oversharpened, but otherwise technically well done -- and it made me smile, which is a big plus!', '2005-11-28 17:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
