(1902997, 261120, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wow - so that''s where Christmas ornaments come from! Brings a whole new perspective to the phrase "trim the tree...."<br/> <br/>The photo is effectively composed, but the lighting is lacking, I''m afraid, making it a tad too dark.</td>', 'Wow - so that''s where Christmas ornaments come from! Brings a whole new perspective to the phrase "trim the tree...." The photo is effectively composed, but the lighting is lacking, I''m afraid, making it a tad too dark.', '2005-11-28 18:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903003, 258399, 46020, '<td valign="top">7 =-)</td>', '7 =-)', '2005-11-28 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903004, 260553, 24940, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  :))   "ODD", indeed!  The focus is a little too soft and the lighting is a bit off.  Also, the orange juice(?) is too distracting by being only helf-way in the frame and so brightly lit.  Upper right corner and right edge are too empty - need something to help fill the space or to be cropped away a little to lessen the dead area.</td>', 'Great idea!  :))   "ODD", indeed!  The focus is a little too soft and the lighting is a bit off.  Also, the orange juice(?) is too distracting by being only helf-way in the frame and so brightly lit.  Upper right corner and right edge are too empty - need something to help fill the space or to be cropped away a little to lessen the dead area.', '2005-11-28 18:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903007, 261014, 25218, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice candid shot. You made an excellent choice presenting this in black &amp; white, and it''s well-composed, too. I may be projecting, but he looks like he''s waiting for his wife to finish her shopping, and I can appreciate how that feels....</td>', 'This is a very nice candid shot. You made an excellent choice presenting this in black & white, and it''s well-composed, too. I may be projecting, but he looks like he''s waiting for his wife to finish her shopping, and I can appreciate how that feels....', '2005-11-28 18:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903010, 261095, 43400, '<td valign="top">I like this one--it''s odd-9</td>', 'I like this one--it''s odd-9', '2005-11-28 18:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903013, 259679, 43400, '<td valign="top">intereisting, but not sure what it is--</td>', 'intereisting, but not sure what it is--', '2005-11-28 18:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903015, 260703, 25218, '<td valign="top">Very serene, almost dream-like image. The wider border top &amp; bottom adds to the feeling of nostalgia or remembrance, somehow, maybe because it looks like a slide? I like this a lot.</td>', 'Very serene, almost dream-like image. The wider border top & bottom adds to the feeling of nostalgia or remembrance, somehow, maybe because it looks like a slide? I like this a lot.', '2005-11-28 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903018, 259846, 43400, '<td valign="top">cool--very creative--should be in winners'' circle-9</td>', 'cool--very creative--should be in winners'' circle-9', '2005-11-28 18:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903021, 261162, 25218, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous family! The light could be softer, as my eyes seem to be pulled to the bright area of the woman''s face, but overall it''s an excellent capture of a special moment. Well done!</td>', 'A gorgeous family! The light could be softer, as my eyes seem to be pulled to the bright area of the woman''s face, but overall it''s an excellent capture of a special moment. Well done!', '2005-11-28 18:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903024, 260630, 43400, '<td valign="top">very interesting--how was it''s breath?</td>', 'very interesting--how was it''s breath?', '2005-11-28 18:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903026, 261163, 46020, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful shot.  The border really adds to it.  I''d hang this on my wall.  Don''t see anything odd about it though. . .</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful shot.  The border really adds to it.  I''d hang this on my wall.  Don''t see anything odd about it though. . .', '2005-11-28 18:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
