(1904226, 260352, 30881, '<td valign="top">Nice phot technique, showing texture and grainy touch. Voters may find subject matter a bit ho hum though. I think it shows good imagination. Good luck</td>', 'Nice phot technique, showing texture and grainy touch. Voters may find subject matter a bit ho hum though. I think it shows good imagination. Good luck', '2005-11-29 09:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
