(1904295, 261153, 30881, '<td valign="top">Good one! Shows great imagination and really like the lighting effect. If you tried getting any sharper it would probably lose most of the effect you''ve achieved. Good job!</td>', 'Good one! Shows great imagination and really like the lighting effect. If you tried getting any sharper it would probably lose most of the effect you''ve achieved. Good job!', '2005-11-29 10:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
