(1904411, 259997, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good picture. But can be more acurate in the color of dices. The blued tone may be a wrong white balance setting or a reflected light from the blue background. The first are a bit simple, setup and try other settings, the second requires a new light point or alternative light source.</td>', 'Good picture. But can be more acurate in the color of dices. The blued tone may be a wrong white balance setting or a reflected light from the blue background. The first are a bit simple, setup and try other settings, the second requires a new light point or alternative light source.', '2005-11-29 11:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
