(1904745, 260113, 24846, '<td valign="top">This has potential, but unfortunately is overexsposed. With this nice setup, look at different time of day to use the natural light. With 5 cats to pose like this I hope to see them in a future challenge.</td>', 'This has potential, but unfortunately is overexsposed. With this nice setup, look at different time of day to use the natural light. With 5 cats to pose like this I hope to see them in a future challenge.', '2005-11-29 14:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
