(1904763, 260615, 24846, '<td valign="top">Here''s a ribbon winner. Flower grabs my attention and then I drift toward her deep brown peep, over the touch of nose and rest on her soft parting lip, full circle back to flower. Good crop, like the high key effect and color tones of hair and facial and chin features. Minor quibble of what appears to be blemishes on chin but may be my monitor. <br/>Good luck with this floral wonder. -10-</td>', 'Here''s a ribbon winner. Flower grabs my attention and then I drift toward her deep brown peep, over the touch of nose and rest on her soft parting lip, full circle back to flower. Good crop, like the high key effect and color tones of hair and facial and chin features. Minor quibble of what appears to be blemishes on chin but may be my monitor. Good luck with this floral wonder. -10-', '2005-11-29 15:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1904766, 259933, 10634, '<td valign="top">The tree leaning in on the left throws this off. Maybe standing to the left and a little closer?? Or closer looking up at one of them with that awesome sky as the background?</td>', 'The tree leaning in on the left throws this off. Maybe standing to the left and a little closer?? Or closer looking up at one of them with that awesome sky as the background?', '2005-11-29 15:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
