(1904824, 259738, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and I love the DOF on this.  Well composed...what''s not to like!  A rare 10 from me - super job!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and I love the DOF on this.  Well composed...what''s not to like!  A rare 10 from me - super job!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-29 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1904827, 260387, 45926, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. If the card looked more used though, I think that this would be EXTREMELY cool. Looks like something you''d see in a magic show. (Obviously, but I''d like to point that out.) ^_^</td>', 'I really like this picture. If the card looked more used though, I think that this would be EXTREMELY cool. Looks like something you''d see in a magic show. (Obviously, but I''d like to point that out.) ^_^', '2005-11-29 15:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1904830, 260939, 45926, '<td valign="top">Nice border. The bottom half of the picture I think looks really nice, but the top sort of looks a little pixelized? I''m not sure.. I like the paint(?) splatters on the toilet. Very funny idea.</td>', 'Nice border. The bottom half of the picture I think looks really nice, but the top sort of looks a little pixelized? I''m not sure.. I like the paint(?) splatters on the toilet. Very funny idea.', '2005-11-29 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
