(1904951, 260683, 48467, '<td valign="top">In this contest, interpreting "odd" to mean "odd numbers" rather than "bizarre" makes it much more difficult to create a unique or interesting shot. Show me something I haven''t seen a million times before.</td>', 'In this contest, interpreting "odd" to mean "odd numbers" rather than "bizarre" makes it much more difficult to create a unique or interesting shot. Show me something I haven''t seen a million times before.', '2005-11-29 17:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
