(1905009, 260894, 48467, '<td valign="top">I''ve been scoring "odd number" shots low because most of them are total bores -- if a shot wouldn''t be taken outside of this competition, why take it at all? A photo that is technically great still deserves a low score if it''s another darn picture of a die. But your "odd number" shot is very, very good. Definitely one of my favorite photos so far.</td>', 'I''ve been scoring "odd number" shots low because most of them are total bores -- if a shot wouldn''t be taken outside of this competition, why take it at all? A photo that is technically great still deserves a low score if it''s another darn picture of a die. But your "odd number" shot is very, very good. Definitely one of my favorite photos so far.', '2005-11-29 17:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
