(1905231, 260999, 43888, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred to have the second door cropped out, and zoomed in closer to the guy</td>', 'Would have preferred to have the second door cropped out, and zoomed in closer to the guy', '2005-11-29 18:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905239, 260483, 43888, '<td valign="top">Picture is very nice, but contrast could have been more - would have been more dramatic</td>', 'Picture is very nice, but contrast could have been more - would have been more dramatic', '2005-11-29 18:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905242, 260444, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this - at last, I was despairing. Of course the near silhouette of that left-fore couple, and their pose absolutely make it - but as much, I think, because of the construction of the composition - all lines lead to the centre standing bloke, and his curious upward gaze. The only thing I would say, and absolutely say, is that this must be a black and white shot. It just cries out for it - it would move the entire subject out of the boviously humdrum, and make a grest deal more of the strange shapes and relationships here. Marvellous work, otherwise.</td>', 'I like this - at last, I was despairing. Of course the near silhouette of that left-fore couple, and their pose absolutely make it - but as much, I think, because of the construction of the composition - all lines lead to the centre standing bloke, and his curious upward gaze. The only thing I would say, and absolutely say, is that this must be a black and white shot. It just cries out for it - it would move the entire subject out of the boviously humdrum, and make a grest deal more of the strange shapes and relationships here. Marvellous work, otherwise.', '2005-11-29 18:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905281, 260662, 38725, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, well done ;)</td>', 'Excellent shot, well done ;)', '2005-11-29 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905284, 258623, 38725, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrasting colours</td>', 'Nice use of contrasting colours', '2005-11-29 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905290, 261081, 36999, '<td valign="top">Good idea, exposure.  I would have liked to see greater depth of field or focus and not so centered of a composition</td>', 'Good idea, exposure.  I would have liked to see greater depth of field or focus and not so centered of a composition', '2005-11-29 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905296, 260683, 36999, '<td valign="top">if you set this up, sun on the front of the row of cars would have been better the shadow is killing the details</td>', 'if you set this up, sun on the front of the row of cars would have been better the shadow is killing the details', '2005-11-29 19:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
