(1905512, 260444, 24846, '<td valign="top">I see what you mean... Great composition pulling my eyes left from collar adjusters, to podium stander, to red coat, to peering couple. Love the colors, clouds, and the way they cast shadow over collar adjusters to podium. May only quibble is there may be a bit over blue saturation in top of sky, or it may be my monitor.  How long / many shots to capture this scene I''ve seen? I hope this ribbons.<br/>-10-</td>', 'I see what you mean... Great composition pulling my eyes left from collar adjusters, to podium stander, to red coat, to peering couple. Love the colors, clouds, and the way they cast shadow over collar adjusters to podium. May only quibble is there may be a bit over blue saturation in top of sky, or it may be my monitor.  How long / many shots to capture this scene I''ve seen? I hope this ribbons.-10-', '2005-11-29 21:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
