(1905736, 260457, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''ll buy into "odd" in this one! The photo itself is probably not that strong simply because there''s so much background that you had to work around.  You may have lost the ship and seperated the yoga man from the crowd if you''d sat on the ground and shot upwards?</td>', 'I''ll buy into "odd" in this one! The photo itself is probably not that strong simply because there''s so much background that you had to work around.  You may have lost the ship and seperated the yoga man from the crowd if you''d sat on the ground and shot upwards?', '2005-11-29 22:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905740, 260643, 42984, '<td valign="top">Odd title on an odd challenge but maybe with not a very odd image.  Having siad that, the colours and form s in the image are stunning, they just don''t push oddity. The test is what it would be without the title.</td>', 'Odd title on an odd challenge but maybe with not a very odd image.  Having siad that, the colours and form s in the image are stunning, they just don''t push oddity. The test is what it would be without the title.', '2005-11-29 22:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
