(1905774, 260679, 45926, '<td valign="top">Love the mask, the picture has a mysterious creepy yet interesting feeling to it. It''s like, at first you laugh at the mask, but then as you continue to look, you realize that the mask has a whole nother thing behind it, which may be perfectly normal. The mask is the thing that gives it the personality. Hm.. just my weird interpretation. ^_^ excellent focus and lighting.</td>', 'Love the mask, the picture has a mysterious creepy yet interesting feeling to it. It''s like, at first you laugh at the mask, but then as you continue to look, you realize that the mask has a whole nother thing behind it, which may be perfectly normal. The mask is the thing that gives it the personality. Hm.. just my weird interpretation. ^_^ excellent focus and lighting.', '2005-11-29 22:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905778, 261145, 42984, '<td valign="top">Fascinating coinage.  The image draws me into studying it</td>', 'Fascinating coinage.  The image draws me into studying it', '2005-11-29 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
