(1907429, 261165, 34171, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the comments everyone.  Yeah, I would have loved getting the airplane sharper, but it''s not like I had time to set this shot up.  I was at a local bird preserve and was going to shoot Sand Hill Cranes in front of the rising full Moon and had just set the camera on my tripod and was dialing in the exposure when I noticed the plane coming into the frame so it was panic time.  He was to that far away from me, so he was moving fairly fast through the frame and I was sweating bullets that I''d miss him.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for your comments and your votes.<br/></td>', 'Thank you for the comments everyone.  Yeah, I would have loved getting the airplane sharper, but it''s not like I had time to set this shot up.  I was at a local bird preserve and was going to shoot Sand Hill Cranes in front of the rising full Moon and had just set the camera on my tripod and was dialing in the exposure when I noticed the plane coming into the frame so it was panic time.  He was to that far away from me, so he was moving fairly fast through the frame and I was sweating bullets that I''d miss him. Thanks again for your comments and your votes.', '2005-11-30 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
