(1929365, 259530, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I think you were defiantly thinking outside the normal box with your "Different" entry into the Odd Challenge.  I like the approach you chose, they were actually a few different egg ideas out there and your did not look like any of the rest.  Also great choice on green apple to draw attention in.  I think the photo itself could have used a couple of different things to get voted higher.  Possibly the focus seems a little soft, I know how hard focusing can be depending on the environment and  subject. The focus also could have been affected by the flash.  I might have tried a couple of different angles and perspectives for that different look.  Also I might have tried that different angle showing less of your back drop or change the color of your backdrop.  The box almost blends into the background.  I might even play with adjusting the contrast to give the box more depth.  Overall I think you had an excellent idea keep up the good work.</td>', '*Critique Club* I think you were defiantly thinking outside the normal box with your "Different" entry into the Odd Challenge.  I like the approach you chose, they were actually a few different egg ideas out there and your did not look like any of the rest.  Also great choice on green apple to draw attention in.  I think the photo itself could have used a couple of different things to get voted higher.  Possibly the focus seems a little soft, I know how hard focusing can be depending on the environment and  subject. The focus also could have been affected by the flash.  I might have tried a couple of different angles and perspectives for that different look.  Also I might have tried that different angle showing less of your back drop or change the color of your backdrop.  The box almost blends into the background.  I might even play with adjusting the contrast to give the box more depth.  Overall I think you had an excellent idea keep up the good work.', '2005-12-06 22:20:20.000000', NULL, 0),
