(2237466, 259933, 54755, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t resist!  I saw this image and I knew just why they named these "Hornet Balls"  I was visiting an Uncle in North Caolina and he had found this leaf with a "hornet ball" on it.  So I thought I would share with you with a a little photoshop fun.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=307985" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/54755/thumb/307985.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/54755/thumb/307985.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/54755/thumb/307985.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I couldn''t resist!  I saw this image and I knew just why they named these "Hornet Balls"  I was visiting an Uncle in North Caolina and he had found this leaf with a "hornet ball" on it.  So I thought I would share with you with a a little photoshop fun. ', '2006-03-18 12:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
